L["Use |cFFFFD100/hekili set|r to adjust toggles, display modes, and specialization settings via chat commands or macros.\n\n"] = "Utilise |cFFFFD100/hekili set|r pour régler les bascules, les modes d’affichage et les réglages de spécialisation par commande de chat ou macro.\n\n"
L["Toggle Options:\n - |cFFFFD100cooldowns|r, |cFFFFD100potions|r, |cFFFFD100interrupts|r, |cFFFFD100movement|r, etc.\n - Example commands:\n   - Enable Cooldowns: |cFFFFD100/hek set cooldowns on|r\n   - Disable Interrupts: |cFFFFD100/hek set interrupts off|r\n   - Toggle Defensives: |cFFFFD100/hek set defensives|r\n\n"] = "Bascules :\n - |cFFFFD100cooldowns|r, |cFFFFD100potions|r, |cFFFFD100interrupts|r, |cFFFFD100movement|r, etc.\n - Exemples de commandes :\n   - Activer les temps de recharge : |cFFFFD100/hek set cooldowns on|r\n   - Désactiver les interruptions : |cFFFFD100/hek set interrupts off|r\n   - Basculer les défensifs : |cFFFFD100/hek set defensives|r\n\n"
L["Display Mode Control (currently |cFFFFD100%s|r):\n"] = "Mode d’affichage (actuel : |cFFFFD100%s|r) :\n"
L["unknown"] = "inconnu"
L[" - Toggle Mode: |cFFFFD100/hek set mode|r\n - Set specific mode:\n   - |cFFFFD100/hek set mode automatic|r\n   - |cFFFFD100/hek set mode single|r\n   - |cFFFFD100/hek set mode aoe|r\n   - |cFFFFD100/hek set mode dual|r\n   - |cFFFFD100/hek set mode reactive|r\n\n"] = " - Changer de mode : |cFFFFD100/hek set mode|r\n - Choisir un mode précis :\n   - |cFFFFD100/hek set mode automatic|r\n   - |cFFFFD100/hek set mode single|r\n   - |cFFFFD100/hek set mode aoe|r\n   - |cFFFFD100/hek set mode dual|r\n   - |cFFFFD100/hek set mode reactive|r\n\n"
L["Target Swap Setting:\n - Toggle Target Swap: |cFFFFD100/hek set cycle|r\n - Set minimum time to die for target swaps: |cFFFFD100/hek set cycle #|r (0-20)\n - Enable: |cFFFFD100/hek set cycle on|r\n - Disable: |cFFFFD100/hek set cycle off|r\n\n"] = "Changement de cible :\n - Basculer le changement de cible : |cFFFFD100/hek set cycle|r\n - Temps avant la mort minimum pour changer de cible : |cFFFFD100/hek set cycle #|r (0-20)\n - Activer : |cFFFFD100/hek set cycle on|r\n - Désactiver : |cFFFFD100/hek set cycle off|r\n\n"
L["Specialization Settings for %s:\n"] = "Réglages de spécialisation pour %s :\n"
L["your specialization"] = "ta spécialisation"
L["|cFF00FF00ON"] = "|cFF00FF00ACTIVÉ"
L["|cFFFF0000OFF"] = "|cFFFF0000DÉSACTIVÉ"
